	(text "PHN: GATE BIAS (PER PHASE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109 182.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14b28db9-4f9d-5344-9cc0-e39f4df5b90e")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 3.65k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 107.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6171672f-5be0-55ca-a159-8cbf2ba7c547")
	)
	(text "NL: DRIVER AND 6 GATES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.536 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6821807c-5f14-5b34-98e5-9e47f6156e43")
	)
	(text "NL: DESAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 182.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "70e7bec9-a0ac-583b-befb-a417b6d1a6d7")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.387 71.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7decf3ff-589b-51ca-a810-262ca0bca602")
	)
	(text "NL: SHORT-CIRCUIT BOOSTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 661.2298 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a34cc53-79df-53e4-b6b9-e3deef776f7d")
	)
	(text "NL: TURN-OFF BUFFER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.387 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9c1cb830-75f9-53b2-9dd4-1ae544a054cc")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 661.2298 82.392 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9c8df2a3-79f8-5de6-b1ca-1cffe4a577f5")
	)
	(text "NL: MILLER CLAMP CONTROL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 549.879 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aa00c9c4-16cf-53a5-b1e9-23eb19683f3c")
	)
	(text "Gate and Kelvin of each device as coupled pairs of equal length from the COM star; Ron, Roff, Kelvin R, 10k + 1n,\nZeners and the clamp FET + C_VL at each device (loop <= 1 nH). PNP followers next to their three gates. DESAT\nstring >= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; coat to PD1. Miller hold of six gates NOT simulated - BENCH TEST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 306.856 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c4df89c6-7c4d-58f8-a630-ce239ef1bce3")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 549.879 106.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d143e670-9a45-555a-abb6-5443d6c40263")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.536 170.292 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d7067960-2b55-5a36-bf11-b64c819a052f")
	)
	(text "LEG N: LAYOUT RULES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 289.356 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dcb49426-abab-5096-9bc7-c5b4c42b6ebe")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 2 x US1M - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 251.772 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dd9131a7-e65c-5588-9a41-4ccb5a54924b")
	)
